This profile opted out of bundled-skill seeding.

Effect: `hermes profile create` / `hermes update` will NOT copy Hermes'
bundled skill catalog into this profile's skills/ directory. The profile
ships its own skills and stays clean.

Note: this does NOT hide the global skill catalog at runtime. There is no
per-profile runtime allow-list in Hermes v0.20.x (only `skills.disabled`,
a deny-list).

Delete this file to re-enable bundled-skill sync on the next `hermes update`.
